---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Divisi Pelayanan - JKI MAWAR SARON" currentPage="ministry">
  <section class="page-header text-center">
    <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5">
      <span class="church-badge mb-3">Serve Together</span>
      <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Divisi Pelayanan</h1>
      <p class="lead text-secondary mx-auto" style="max-width: 680px;">
        Setiap orang dipanggil untuk melayani sesuai dengan karunia dan talenta yang Tuhan percayakan. Temukan tempat Anda untuk bertumbuh dan memberi dampak.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5 my-5">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/impact-kids.jpg" alt="Impact Kids" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Anak-anak</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">Impact Kids</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Membina iman anak-anak sejak dini melalui cerita Alkitab yang interaktif, pujian kreatif, dan lingkungan kelas yang aman serta penuh kasih.
            </p>
            <a href="/kids-impact" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/nextgen.jpg" alt="NextGen Youth" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Pemuda & Remaja</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">NextGen (Youth Impact)</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Komunitas remaja dan pemuda yang dinamis, membekali generasi muda agar berani hidup teguh dalam kebenaran dan menjadi terang di sekolah serta kampus.
            </p>
            <a href="/nextgen" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/praise-and-worship.jpg" alt="Praise and Worship" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Musik & Pujian</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">Praise and Worship</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Membawa jemaat masuk ke dalam hadirat Allah melalui pujian dan penyembahan yang berakar pada Firman dan dipenuhi pengurapan Roh Kudus.
            </p>
            <a href="/praiseadnworship" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/diakonia.jpeg" alt="Diakonia" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Pelayanan Kasih</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">Diakonia</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Mewujudkan kasih Kristus secara nyata bagi mereka yang membutuhkan bantuan medis, sembako, dukungan sosial, dan perhatian kasih.
            </p>
            <a href="/diakonia" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/usher.jpg" alt="Usher Pelayanan" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Hospitality</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">Usher & Hospitality</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Menyambut setiap jemaat dan tamu dengan senyuman hangat, membantu pengaturan tempat duduk, dan memastikan kenyamanan selama ibadah.
            </p>
            <a href="/usher" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="church-card h-100 d-flex flex-column">
          <div style="height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
            <img src="/assets/img/Background/creative.jpg" alt="Creative Media" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
            <span class="church-badge mb-2 align-self-start">Media & Visual</span>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">Creative & Multimedia</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Mengelola produksi visual, tata suara, live streaming YouTube, fotografi, dan konten digital untuk menyebarkan kabar baik secara lebih luas.
            </p>
            <a href="/creative" class="btn-church-primary mt-3">
              Detail Pelayanan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
